Node ID=10 first entry
Text=<"We reached the abbey at dusk. The abbot met us at the gate and would not hear of swords in his sanctuary, so we camp outside the wall tonight. Twelve of us, and the abbey's own brothers within. He says the Crown has been safe here three hundred years. Ferran says three hundred years is how long it takes anyone to get careless.">
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=11 second entry
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=11 second entry
Text=<"Third day. They came out of the trees at first light. Snakes with the faces of women, and men in black behind them who did not shout and did not break. Ferran took a poisoned blade at the gate and was dead before he fell. We hold the door. I have sent word to the brothers to bar the sanctuary.">
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=
Go to node ID=12 last entry
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=12 last entry
Text=<"The door is lost. We fall back to the hall. If any man finds this: the relic is what they came for, and they will not stop at one. Tell Brother Michel at Montaillou. Tell Lord Javier we did not run. Tomas de Vilanova, Knight of the Temple.">
Should Have Voiceover=0

